What''s the idea expressed by can''t in the sentence?', '[{"letra": "A", "texto": "Ability."}, {"letra": "B", "texto": "Prohibition."}, {"letra": "C", "texto": "Don''t need to."}, {"letra": "D", "texto": "Obligation."}, {"letra": "E", "texto": "Possibility."}]', 'B', 'No contexto de quarentena sanitária, a expressão "can''t go out" indica uma proibição / restrição de circulação social impostas pelas autoridades.', NULL, NULL, 'resumida', FALSE, FALSE, '001cb11acfe589ed7ac932a12aa6f0c909a871c341b5fc9e01c05bbc07c3caad', 'cn-2021-dia1.txt'),
('CN', 'Inglês', 'Compreensão e Interpretação de Texto', 2021, '1º dia', 'Marinha do Brasil (SSPM)', 25, '25', NULL, 'facil', NULL, 'The best title for the text is', '[{"letra": "A", "texto": "British students reflect on their experiences with distance learning."}, {"letra": "B", "texto": "Distance learning in the pandemic: students prefer studying at home."}, {"letra": "C", "texto": "Distance learning success in West Contra Costa Unified schools."}, {"letra": "D", "texto": "Student perspectives: the pros and cons of distance learning in 2020."}, {"letra": "E", "texto": "How to motivate students to study harder using distance learning."}]', 'D', 'O texto reúne relatos de diversos estudantes sobre os pontos positivos e negativos do ensino à distância durante 2020, tornando a opção D o título ideal.', NULL, NULL, 'resumida', FALSE, FALSE, '27e578ab32602276bbc18a1b165cd34cf5ec417276f6e9bc4073caf590afbdbe', 'cn-2021-dia1.txt'),
('CN', 'Inglês', 'Compreensão e Interpretação de Texto', 2021, '1º dia', 'Marinha do Brasil (SSPM)', 26, '26', NULL, 'facil', NULL, 'One of the students pointed out an advantage of studying from home during the pandemic. Who is this student and what is the advantage mentioned?', '[{"letra": "A", "texto": "Nayeli Mercado: her mental health has been more controllable."}, {"letra": "B", "texto": "Dana Reyes: she has been more motivated studying virtually."}, {"letra": "C", "texto": "Sarahi Yupit: she can concentrate more because she is alone."}, {"letra": "D", "texto": "Yashika Joshi: she has learned much more with the assignments."}, {"letra": "E", "texto": "Mekayla Saechao: she became more organized with her works."}]', 'E', 'Mekayla Saechao destaca como vantagem do estudo em casa o fato de ter se tornado mais organizada com suas tarefas ("helped me become more organized with my works").', NULL, NULL, 'resumida', FALSE, FALSE, 'e2376f2d66677e54e8ac8e6e7e3f7baec09cd2622d689d07d859ce69f122f9e1', 'cn-2021-dia1.txt'),
('CN', 'Inglês', 'Compreensão e Interpretação de Texto', 2021, '1º dia', 'Marinha do Brasil (SSPM)', 27, '27', NULL, 'facil', NULL, 'All students below are in the last year of their courses, EXCEPT for', '[{"letra": "A", "texto": "Ricardo Castillo."}, {"letra": "B", "texto": "Dana Reyes."}, {"letra": "C", "texto": "Alizei De Leon."}, {"letra": "D", "texto": "Monishlla Maharaj."}, {"letra": "E", "texto": "Yashika Joshi."}]', 'C', 'Ricardo, Dana, Monishlla e Yashika são definidos como "senior" (último ano). Alizei De Leon é definida no texto como "sophomore" (segundo ano).', NULL, NULL, 'resumida', FALSE, FALSE, '95e91a890a2ff75d1044ee03d87271b0b4fa1082dc7bcd8fbbfa3d3277a36196', 'cn-2021-dia1.txt'),
('CN', 'Inglês', 'Compreensão e Interpretação de Texto', 2021, '1º dia', 'Marinha do Brasil (SSPM)', 28, '28', NULL, 'facil', 'Text II
10 Shorts Not to Miss at 2020''s Annecy
"Carne" (Camila Kater, Abano Produciónes, Doctela, Brazil, Spain)
Camila Kater''s debut short is ___ fresh, unprejudiced reflection on femininity through successive stages of life. A resourceful documentary, "Carne" mixes diverse techniques such as paint, watercolor, stop motion, 35mm film and virtual imagery decomposition to obtain a harmonious, vindicating ensemble narrated by five women from childhood to old age, from around the world. Produced by Spain''s Abano and Brazil''s Doctela, it premiered last year at Locarno, earning a special mention. Multiple further awards followed.
https://www.google.com/amp/s/variety.com/2020/film/festivals/10-shorts-not-to-miss-2020-annecy-1234641312/amp/', 'According to the text, it is correct to say that "Carne"', '[{"letra": "A", "texto": "has won just one prize."}, {"letra": "B", "texto": "is considered a must-see documentary."}, {"letra": "C", "texto": "was written by five women."}, {"letra": "D", "texto": "is short, slow and colorful."}, {"letra": "E", "texto": "is a short about human stages of life."}]', 'E', 'O texto II descreve "Carne" como uma reflexão sobre a feminilidade ao longo das sucessivas fases da vida humana ("successive stages of life").', NULL, NULL, 'resumida', FALSE, FALSE, 'b0dd53492fbd3718970a3bc4fa0decd5a1a6763441754be038ed5804b0b089c5', 'cn-2021-dia1.txt'),
('CN', 'Inglês', 'Gramática (Artigos Indefinidos)', 2021, '1º dia', 'Marinha do Brasil (SSPM)', 29, '29', NULL, 'facil', NULL, 'Read the following sentence.
"Camila Kater''s debut short is ___ fresh, unprejudiced reflection on femininity through successive stages of life."
