Which option completes the sentence correctly?', '[{"letra": "A", "texto": "have already set"}, {"letra": "B", "texto": "have already sat"}, {"letra": "C", "texto": "have sit"}, {"letra": "D", "texto": "even have sat"}, {"letra": "E", "texto": "have set yet"}]', 'A', 'A estrutura exige o Present Perfect com o particípio do verbo "set" (que é "set") e o advérbio "already" na posição correta: "have already set".', NULL, NULL, 'resumida', FALSE, FALSE, 'f512a871bfd9abfcbf259ff1bdc7364267a10eb27bd0ebe0c126d5eaa2c2a6b1', 'cn-2021-dia1.txt'),
('CN', 'Inglês', 'Vocabulário e Expressões Idiomáticas', 2021, '1º dia', 'Marinha do Brasil (SSPM)', 32, '32', NULL, 'medio', NULL, 'What''s the meaning of the expression hangs in the balance in "... coasts, forests, farms, and snow-capped mountains — hangs in the balance."? It', '[{"letra": "A", "texto": "stays the same."}, {"letra": "B", "texto": "will last forever."}, {"letra": "C", "texto": "can''t change any time."}, {"letra": "D", "texto": "is uncertain."}, {"letra": "E", "texto": "is difficult to believe."}]', 'D', 'A expressão idiomática "hangs in the balance" significa que algo está num estado de incerteza, ameaçado ou com resultado indefinido ("is uncertain").', NULL, NULL, 'resumida', FALSE, FALSE, '11e27c885c73272e5fb4d7bf5994b1bb5514d10c94edcab4fe53b206061eb0a1', 'cn-2021-dia1.txt'),
('CN', 'Inglês', 'Gramática (Graus de Comparação dos Adjetivos)', 2021, '1º dia', 'Marinha do Brasil (SSPM)', 33, '33', NULL, 'facil', 'TEXT IV
Generation Z News - Latest Characteristics, Research, and Facts
Generation Z (aka Gen Z, iGen, or centennials), refers to the generation that was born between 1996-2010, following millennials. This generation has been raised on the internet and social media, with some the oldest finishing college by 2020 and entering the workforce.

Generation Z is the youngest, most ethnically-diverse, and largest generation in American history, comprising 27% of the US population. Pew Research recently defined Gen Z as anyone born after 1997. Gen Z ___ up with technology, the internet, and social media, which sometimes causes them to be stereotyped as tech-addicted, anti-social, or "social justice warriors."

The average Gen Z got their first smart phone just before their twelfth birthday. They communicate primarily through social media and texts, and spend as much time on their phones as older generations do watching television. The majority of Gen Zs prefer streaming services to traditional cable, as well as getting snackable content they can get on their phones and computers.

Gen Z is the most ethnically diverse and largest generation in American history, and eclipses all other generations before it in embracing diversity and inclusion.
Adapted from https://www.businessinsider.com/generation-z', 'All the sentences have comparative or superlative adjectives EXCEPT for', '[{"letra": "A", "texto": "\"this generation has been raised on the internet and social media, with some the oldest finishing college by 2020 and entering the workforce.\""}, {"letra": "B", "texto": "\"generation Z, is the youngest, most ethnically-diverse, and largest generation in American history, comprising 27% of the US population.\""}, {"letra": "C", "texto": "\"they communicate primarily through social media and texts, and spend as much time on their phones as older generations do watching television.\""}, {"letra": "D", "texto": "\"the majority of Gen Zs prefer streaming services to traditional cable, as well as getting snackable content they can get on their phones and computers.\""}, {"letra": "E", "texto": "\"gen Z is the most ethnically diverse and largest generation in American history, and eclipses all other generations before it in embracing diversity and inclusion.\""}]', 'D', 'A alternativa D contém apenas estruturas de preferência ("prefer... to..."), sem apresentar adjetivos nos graus comparativo ou superlativo.', NULL, NULL, 'resumida', FALSE, FALSE, 'f23b51912f289aab5981bca14292696e8b3c3d610d3ea494200bc54daac0a2c6', 'cn-2021-dia1.txt'),
